urname>Wilson</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Law R, Campbell H, Dolan J</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Heartland Wainuiomata: rurality to suburbs, black singlets to naughty lingerie</article-title><source>Masculinities in Aotearoa/New Zealand</source><year>1999</year><publisher-name>Palmerston North: Dunmore Press</publisher-name><fpage>215</fpage><lpage>228</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ames</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name><name><surname>Rebhun</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Women, alcohol and work: interactions of gender, ethnicity and occupational culture</article-title><source>Social Science and Medicine</source><year>1996</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>1649</fpage><lpage>1663</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8961409</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0277-9536(96)00081-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B31"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hartford</surname><given-names>TC</given-names></name><name><surname>Parker</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Grant</surname><given-names>BF</given-names></name><name><surname>Dawon</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Alcohol use and dependence among employed men and women in the United States in 1988</article-title><source>Alcoholism: clinical and experimental research</source><year>1992</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>146</fpage><lpage>148</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1530-0277.1992.tb01357.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B32"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>ISD Scotland</collab></person-group><article-title>Alcohol-related general acute hospital and psychiatric hospital discharges</article-title><source>Edinburgh</source><year>2007</year><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.isdscotland.org/isd/5335.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>ScotPHO</collab></person-group><source>How much are people in Scotland really drinking? A review of data from Scotland's routine national surveys</source><year>2008</year><publisher-name>Edinburgh and Glasgow: Public Health Observatory Division, Health Scotland</publisher-name></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>